  "reasoning": "The defendant, Zhang, after his wife gave birth to premature twins, demanded that the hospital cease treatment and arranged for the infants to be abandoned by a taxi driver. This conduct constitutes the intentional abandonment of minors, which under Chinese criminal law is punishable as the crime of abandonment (遗弃罪). No other criminal elements such as homicide, kidnapping, or fraud are present in the facts provided.",
